.Language=English,English
.PluginContents=Advanced file select

@Contents
$ #Advanced file select#

    This plugin allows to select files in active panel with some
useful criteria. You may to set a files mask, file size, date(and
time) of file and, finally, you may select necessary file attributes
(i.e. Archive, System, ReadOnly, Hidden, Directory and Compressed
[NTFS only]).
    In the options dialog you can choose selection mode: Set, Clear
or Invert. Option "Clear selection first" allows to switch off any
selected files in active panel.

    It is not necessary to set files size, date, time and attributes at
one time. 

    #Size format:#
    size[k|m|g]               - must equal               
    size[k|m|g]..             - more than or equal       
    ..size[k|m|g]             - less than or equal       
    size[k|m|g]..size[k|m|g]  - between (include borders)

    Suffixes K, M and G equal to Kilo, Mega and Giga.


    #Time format:#
    [hh][:mm]             - must equal
    [hh][:mm]..           - more than or equal
    ..[hh][:mm]           - less than or equal
    [hh][:mm]..[hh][:mm]  - between (include borders)


    #Date format:#
    [dd][/|-]mm][/|-[CC]YY]
    [dd][/|-]mm][/|-[CC]YY]..
    ..[dd][/|-]mm][/|-[CC]YY]
    [dd][/|-]mm][/|-[CC]YY]..[dd][/|-]mm][/|-[CC]YY]

    where:
    dd - Day
    mm - Month
    yy - Year
    cc - Century


    #Some examples:#
    //99       ->  whole 1999
    /10/98     ->  any day/10/1998
    //97..//99 ->  begin from 1/1/1997 to 31/12/1999
    ../10/99   ->  before Oct of 1999
    5/5/98..   ->  after 5 May 1998 ...
    10/5       ->  10/05/any year
    5/5/1      ->  5/05/2001
    and so on...


